# Other Configuration
config SND_SOC_CVITEK_CODEC_DUMMY
    tristate "CVITEK dummy codec driver"
    depends on SND
    help
     Say y or m if you want to add support for CVITEK dummy codec driver.
     This is used for testing or special purposes without actual codec hardware.
     Say N, if not support

config SND_SOC_CVITEK_CARD_DUMMY
    tristate "CVITEK dummy sound card driver"
    depends on SND
    select SND_CVITEK_I2S
    select SND_CVITEK_I2S_SUBSYS
    select SND_SOC_CVITEK_CODEC_DUMMY
    help
     Say Y or M if you want to add support for CVITEK dummy sound card.
     This will enable the dummy sound card along with required I2S driver.
     Typically used for testing or special purposes.
     Say N, if not support
